  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place potato on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the potato between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63e9e40c8301206c2d0684f4/step-0ddec3f1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain sweetcorn. Thinly slice spring onion. Pick and roughly chop mint leaves.\n• In a medium bowl, combine corn, spring onion, mint, shredded Cheddar cheese, the plain flour and chermoula spice blend. Add the egg, milk, vegetable stock powder and a pinch of pepper. Mix well. TIP: Lift out some of the mixture with a spoon. If it's too wet and doesn't hold its shape, add a little more flour!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63e9e40c8301206c2d0684f4/step-96924c66.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, add heaped tablespoons of the fritter mixture, in batches, flattening with a spatula. Cook until golden, 3-4 minutes each side (don't flip too early!).\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. You should get 3-4 fritters per person. TIP: Add extra olive oil between batches as needed",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63e9e40c8301206c2d0684f4/step-df1fe769.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the fritters are cooking, halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Finely shred baby cos lettuce (see ingredients).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63e9e40c8301206c2d0684f4/step-03b0c936.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine tomato, cos lettuce and golden goddess dressing.\n• Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63e9e40c8301206c2d0684f4/step-238a8715.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Middle Eastern-spiced corn fritters, roast potato and cherry tomato salad between plates.\n• Sprinkle over flaked almonds.\n• Serve with garlic sauce. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63e9e40c8301206c2d0684f4/step-4a5d521f.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
